@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@calendarId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@recipientId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
# Follow authentication.http with an unrestricted calendaradmin session.
# Supply the matching HttpOnly advent.auth/advent.csrf cookie pair and fresh token.
@sessionCookies = advent.auth=replace; advent.csrf=replace
@csrfToken = replace-with-principal-bound-request-token

### Create: 201, persisted 24-door calendar and Location header
POST {{baseUrl}}/calendars
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{"title":"  My advent calendar  ","recipientId":"{{recipientId}}","background":"woodland"}

### Owner-only administration / preview: 200 with all content, no-store
GET {{baseUrl}}/calendars/{{calendarId}}
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}

### Own calendar metadata and total count
GET {{baseUrl}}/calendars?offset=0&limit=20
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}

### Explicit save: plain text, title 0-50 and message 0-5000 Unicode code points
PUT {{baseUrl}}/calendars/{{calendarId}}/doors/24
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{"title":"A Christmas surprise","text":"First line\nSecond line"}

### Persist a random arrangement once; repeat reads never reshuffle
PUT {{baseUrl}}/calendars/{{calendarId}}/layout
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{"layout":"random"}

### Change recipient: another existing ordinary user assigned to this owner
PUT {{baseUrl}}/calendars/{{calendarId}}/recipient
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{"recipientId":"{{recipientId}}"}

### Invalid title: 400 with structured title field errors
POST {{baseUrl}}/calendars
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{"title":"   ","recipientId":"{{recipientId}}","background":"woodland"}

### Unknown or foreign-owner calendar: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/calendars/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}

### Anonymous legacy read is denied: 401, no-store
GET {{baseUrl}}/calendars/{{calendarId}}
